{"product_id":"dubai-creek-past-present","title":"Dubai Creek: Past \u0026 Present","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"450\"\u003eDubai Creek Past and Present is a captivating journey through the history and transformation of Dubai Creek and its surrounding areas. The book showcases the evolution of Dubai from a modest pearling and fishing town into a thriving modern city. Filled with rich photographs and insightful commentary, it offers readers a glimpse into the cultural, economic, and architectural changes that shaped the city.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"652\"\u003eIdeal for history enthusiasts, students, and anyone interested in Dubai’s heritage, this book combines visual storytelling with informative text to bring the past and present of Dubai Creek to life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"865\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eProduct details:\u003cbr data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"673\"\u003eAuthor: Narain R. Sawlani\u003cbr data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"701\"\u003ePublisher: Explorer Publishing\u003cbr data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"734\"\u003ePublication Year: 2005\u003cbr data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"759\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"779\"\u003ePages: Approx. 120\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45820753051801,"sku":"14RA325","price":60.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/tmp80_1622731054_5.png?v=1761230718","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/dubai-creek-past-present","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}